bbcode_text = "[center][b]The Rock Pocket Mice Simulation Environment:[/b]

In this simulation, there are mice with two types of fur coat colors: light and dark.

[b]●[/b] What you can see like fur color are referred to as [i]phenotypes[/i], which are determined by the genes that a mouse has. There are two kinds of genes in this simulation that change the fur coat color of mice.

[b]●[/b]  In this simulation, \"AA\", \"Aa\", and \"aa\" are genotypes (genetic makeup) of mice. The fur coat color of a mouse is dependent on its genotype. 

Each clock tick in the simulation is a mouse generation. In each generation, male and female mice move around randomly, search for a partner, and reproduce if they find a partner. [/center]"
text = "The Rock Pocket Mice Simulation Environment:

In this simulation, there are mice with two types of fur coat colors: light and dark.

● What you can see like fur color are referred to as phenotypes, which are determined by the genes that a mouse has. There are two kinds of genes in this simulation that change the fur coat color of mice.

●  In this simulation, \"AA\", \"Aa\", and \"aa\" are genotypes (genetic makeup) of mice. The fur coat color of a mouse is dependent on its genotype. 

Each clock tick in the simulation is a mouse generation. In each generation, male and female mice move around randomly, search for a partner, and reproduce if they find a partner. "
